    "summary": "A PEFT LoRA adapter (rank 16, alpha 32, on all 496 text projections of the attention, gated-delta and MLP blocks) and a native candidate head trained on the frozen Qwen3.8-27B text backbone at `1d4bf0f2ff6012fd82039f2fa52739d0dd7c60c0` (Apache-2.0), which is not redistributed. The adapter is the exact uniform soup of two seeds of one rank-8 recipe (their LoRA factors stacked along the rank with the up-projections halved, so the mean of the two seeds' weight updates is reproduced exactly), with the two heads averaged."
  },
